config HISI_SMMU_LPAE
	bool "Hisilicon LPAE SMMU page-table manager"
	depends on ARM64 && (ARCH_HISI || COMPILE_TEST)
	select IOMMU_API
	help
	  Support for the shared LPAE SMMU page tables used by the media
	  subsystems (ISP, IVP, JPEG) on Hisilicon Kirin SoCs.

	  The secure firmware and the consumer drivers program the SMMU
	  hardware; this driver only manages the three-level page tables.

	  Say Y here if you want to use the SMMU on a Kirin 970 device.

	  If unsure, say N.
